{"key":"AbEvents-pilgrimage.json|/dataList/2/successDesc/0","kr_sha":"eefa3abb0b64e9797192d9b6b3e3ae90dd5f6fdff24ae4b1d7abf4a4598dc93f","zh":"罪人{0}擋在騎士的前路時，那猛烈的奔馳瞬間停了下來。\n\n審判官艾麗妮沒有錯過這個機會。\n手炮噴出火花，那個衝擊震得騎士落馬。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
